<title>USA: Raines sees much lower U.S. FY97 budget deficit.</title>
<headline>Raines sees much lower U.S. FY97 budget deficit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>White House budget director Frank Raines said Friday he saw the fiscal 1997 budget deficit in the mid-$70 billion range.</p>
</text>
